      "grounding": [
        {
          "end_line": 617,
          "quote": "The product works over explicit typed assets or typed nodes. It does not\nwork over one hidden project blob, one giant mutable workspace object or one\nundocumented service payload. Concrete assets must bind explicitly into\ntyped domain boundaries. Where an asset is a real produced or consumed boundary,\nits `asset_surface` is declared (P3).",
