          "start_line": 613
        },
        {
          "end_line": 625,
          "quote": "The real carrier is never left\ninside orchestration loops, bespoke Python pipeline runners, controller\nscripts, or service methods that only happen to call GTL-adjacent helpers\n(P0, P4a).",
          "section_id": "repo://stdo-v3-generation/claude/9aee01ffa76cfbde1a6b8f1153a25bd6d71c216e/source/standards/ODD.md#ODD%2F11.%20Core%20law%2F11.2%20Graph%20functions%20are%20the%20primary%20constructive%20carrier",
