      "key": "explicit_constructive_carriers",
      "statement": "The product must work over explicit typed assets/nodes, not a hidden project blob, giant mutable workspace object or undocumented payload. Concrete assets bind explicitly to domain boundaries, and real produced/consumed boundaries declare asset_surface. Every operative constructive step has one named GraphFunction or lawful composition; its real carrier cannot remain in orchestration loops, bespoke Python runners, controller scripts or service methods merely calling GTL-adjacent helpers.",
