      "key": "outcome_first_construction",
      "statement": "Operative framework behaviour must itself use edge traversal. Required order: declare typed outcome traversal; publish declarative GTL/ABG carrier structure; implement only remaining necessary minimal imperative adapters. Adapter code is lawful only for transporting/persisting facts: file/network IO, CLI/API transport, event persistence, runtime invocation, projection rendering or tool execution already admitted by a declared traversal. Imperative code cannot own domain meaning, semantic target movement, step selection, closure, lineage or constructive workflow truth. Imperative-first framework behaviour later described in GTL is ODD-shaped but not yet ODD-built.",
